Third-party data
----------------
raw/wzperson/hsk-3-0-words.csv
  HSK 3.0 word list by HearMandarin (wzperson),
  https://github.com/wzperson/hearmandarin-hsk-3-0-word-list
  Licensed under CC BY 4.0 (see raw/wzperson/LICENSE).
  source/words.jsonl is adapted from it (words, levels, pinyin, part of
  speech, syllabus order).

raw/unihan/Unihan_hsk.txt, raw/unihan/CJKRadicals.txt
  From the Unicode Character Database (Unihan 18.0.0), Unicode, Inc.,
  https://www.unicode.org/Public/UCD/latest/ucd/
  Licensed under the Unicode License v3 (see raw/unihan/LICENSE).
  The radical field in source/characters.jsonl was prefilled from it.

The scripts in scripts/ are code and are covered by the repository's MIT
license (../LICENSE).
